  IconPath: icons/equipment/neck/amulet-round-star-gold.webp
  Description: "Usage worn headwear or belt (typically a sash) This symbol of victory\u2014whether
    a laurel worn around the head or a medal that hangs from your neck\u2014reminds
    you and your allies that victory is the only acceptable outcome. Immanence (aura,
    emotion, mental) You inspire your allies to greater glory. You and all your allies
    in a 15-foot emanation gain a +1 status bonus to attack rolls. Transcendence\u2014
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.One Moment till Glory] 1 (concentrate,
    emotion, mental, transcendence) @Embed[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.IEBBHnI7wWRt44KG
